    <briefdescription>
<para>Result of injecting one thesis into the discourse context window. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>When a thesis is fully active in the current round and its <computeroutput>token_budget</computeroutput> allows, it is injected at full length (<computeroutput>full_text</computeroutput>). Otherwise a compact headline token is injected instead so the LLM still knows the thesis exists. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
